e bueno que tengas en cuenta que no se siguió al pie de la letra la planificación ni la metodología de trabajo\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a15715-c807-7fe2-90f3-6a731a00b11d","create_time":1792462407.8390372,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]},"guardian_metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a15715-c89f-7d50-951d-45252ba58cf0","turn_id":"01a15715-c807-7fe2-90f3-6a731a00b11d","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_01a15715-c89f-7d50-951d-454c88dddd06","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":6,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"complete","sources":[{"plugin_id":"codex-app-tools@openai-bundled","server_name":"codex_app","tool_name":"load_workspace_dependencies","first_turn_id":"01a15711-8fbb-7142-aee8-2d39e71f9f3c"}]}}},{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_04e06a9245aac484016ad6ce4aef34819197d264712cf54ce3","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Lo tendré presente: la planificación y la metodología documentadas representan lo propuesto, y el trabajo real pudo apartarse de ellas. Cuando revisemos el desarrollo y las pruebas, nos basaremos en lo que efectivamente se hizo, sin forzarlo a encajar en el plan original.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a15715-c807-7fe2-90f3-6a731a00b11d","create_time":1792462410.9404938,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]},"guardian_metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_04e06a9245aac484016ad6ce4aef34819197d264712cf54ce3","turn_id":"01a15715-c807-7fe2-90f3-6a731a00b11d","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a15715-d82b-7ca1-9d35-884294567c96","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":7}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a15717-7425-7620-8258-a91c2e662b9e","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Lo primero que me gustaría tener es el código en latex para la estructura del documento\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_pas