\nLa estructura que te entregué antes era genérica; la siguiente versión podrá basarse en este código. Por ahora no modifiqué nada.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a15721-db92-7d40-b9f6-a18ae92c65c9","create_time":1792463215.914045,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]},"guardian_metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_04e06a9245aac484016ad6d16fe8988191b0560f6a3ded4822","turn_id":"01a15721-db92-7d40-b9f6-a18ae92c65c9","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a15722-2430-7f80-b190-3f938660b560","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":16}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a15723-2502-72b0-9adc-3c935032a282","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Nono, la estructura por ahora dejemosla así, solo quiero que copies lo que encuentres necesario (sin contenido) que agregue valor o deje más completo, como por ejemplo datos, logos, titulos, subtitulos, etc\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a15723-245d-7400-a64a-3dc07a69ba74","create_time":1792463283.458328,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]},"guardian_metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a15723-2502-72b0-9adc-3c935032a282","turn_id":"01a15723-245d-7400-a64a-3dc07a69ba74","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_01a15723-2502-72b0-9adc-3cba87b7b0ff","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":17,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"complete","sources":[{"plugin_id":"codex-app-tools@openai-bundled","server_name":"codex_app","tool_name":"load_workspace_dependencies","first_turn_id":"01a15711-8fbb-7142-aee8-2d39e71f9f3c"}]}}},{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_04e06a9245aac484016ad6d1b731f08191a20e9454406f0b14","summary":[],"content":null,"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq1tG8_3wWESFKhz9zcrQsX9eWY35JWszsYO3kXwUG9b_hMqhn_ekk-5izTxdSfnl-5FgmAAr54lCnvgr_Ubj6f7i9rr8NRXTwIRa-n_UU2Wz7pA1niRLxLGbkuCGprS19IUqj6a8wJJNqNWIsXPNH5-DA6j0kzT2PjC4d1U3b3TglT_OgSk4fwNsWd2qWD8P1nVw4